# Keeps the Docker build context small and avoids leaking local secrets/state
# into the image. The API Dockerfile COPYs only the specific paths it needs, so
# this mainly protects the *upload context* Docker sends to the daemon.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/build
**/.expo
**/ios
**/android
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.tsbuildinfo
